Chapter: NvGspPdirTest
  cites Kernel chapter NvGspPdir
  cites Foreword chapter Format

 The expected output is tinygrad's own rpc_set_page_directory, run by
 Python: build/nv-gsp-pdir-oracle.ps1.

Section: Main

  hex-bytes : List Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  hex-bytes (bs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length bs then acc else hex-bytes bs (i + 1) (acc & fmt-hex-pad (list-at bs i) 2)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni ("F " & show nv-gsp-fn-set-page-directory & " " & hex-bytes (nv-gsp-set-page-directory #C1E00004 #CAF00001 #CAF00003 #123456000 512 #FFFFFFFF) 0 "")
   print-line-uni ("F " & show nv-gsp-fn-set-page-directory & " " & hex-bytes (nv-gsp-set-page-directory #C1D00000 #CAF00011 #CAF00013 #FFFFFFF000 256 5) 0 "")
  end
